(939, 'Tuscan Panzanella Salad', 'A delicious Tuscan salad with tender chicken, Kalamata olives, tomatoes and red onions in a white balsamic dressing tossed with arugula, salad greens, chunks of warm crusty French bread and capers. Tossed with Feta cheese and drizzled with a sweet balsamic', '11.15', 1, 118, 1700),
