(958, 'Parmesan Crusted Chicken', 'A tender, juicy chicken breast with a crispy Parmesan crust atop creamy mashed potatoes with a Parmesan basil cream sauce. Served alongside an arugula herb salad with tomatoes and drizzled with a balsamic glaze.', '12.59', 1, 121, 1300),
(959, 'St. Louis Ribs & BBQ Glazed Chicken', 'St. Louis style BBQ ribs and a grilled BBQ glazed chicken breast. Served with a choice of mashed potatoes, baked potato, rice pilaf or French fries.', '19.19', 1, 122, 1100),
