(971, 'Fit & Lively Mushroom Veggie Burger', 'A gourmet veggie burger with sautéed mushrooms, all-natural pickles, fresh lettuce and tomatoes, red onions and mustard on our wheat bun. Served with fresh fruit.', '10.19', 1, 127, 1100),
